# On macOS, ~/.claude is a symlink to this directory (see ./install), so
# Claude Code writes its runtime state here. Blocklist by choice: a new
# untracked file shows up in `git status` and prompts a decision (track it or
# add it here), at the cost of occasionally committing state by accident.
# NEVER track: .credentials.json (OAuth tokens on Linux hosts).
/.credentials.json
/.last-cleanup
/.stats-cache.json
/backups/
/cache/
/chrome/
/debug/
/file-history/
/history.jsonl
/ide/
/launcher-settings.json
/plans/
/plugins/
/policy-limits.json
/projects/
/session-env
/sessions/
/shell-snapshots/
/stats-cache.json
/statsig/
/tasks/
/telemetry/
/todos/
